# The repository root ignores `data/` (.gitignore:40), which silently swallowed
# this directory: the vendored NIST .dat files stayed untracked, every hash test
# passed locally off the working tree, and all eleven failed in CI where the
# checkout had no files at all. Re-include them here rather than editing the
# root rule, which belongs to another owner.
!data/
!data/*.dat
